      "id": "COLOR-01",
      "finding": "Foreground large leaves and rear shrubbery have different hue/value structure; use material-matched sampling and in-context review before saturation adjustment. Larger darker leaf masses naturally differ from tiny sunlit leaves; do not flatten useful depth."
    },
    {
      "id": "COLOR-02",
      "finding": "Older ambient overlays used a different night multiplier than the backdrop and new plants. The opt-in whole-scene profile now aligns five ambient cards to (0.48,0.56,0.82); runtime values and captures verified. Broad night color acceptance remains open."
    },
    {
      "id": "COLOR-03",
      "finding": "Cyan extraction fringes falsely increase edge saturation; twelve cleaned cloud candidates address a separate matte issue, not a scene-wide grade."
    },
