      "id": "COLOR-04",
      "finding": "Sampled arrival rear/foreground foliage median HSV saturation is 0.9255/0.9333 versus meadow 0.6627/0.6588 and castle 0.6745/0.6784. These are nine mapped sample regions, not whole-stage statistics. Arrival foreground median linear luminance 0.0789 versus rear 0.1158; stronger darkness adds perceived intensity."
    }
  ],
